  "visual_review": "Continuing from `3b3caa0`, the forearms hang closer beneath the elbows and a shaped collar follows the neck, with a smaller continuous zipper and pull. Three pinned CC0 MakeHuman morph targets add restrained facial-age and eyelid changes in memory; the original anatomical OBJ remains unchanged. Native irises now carry radial color variation, finer brows follow a changing hair direction, and 96 tapered eyelashes are rooted at the actual visible lid margins. These details remain subtle and do not establish a lifelike facial expression.",
  "body_detail_review": "The footwear now has recessed ankle openings with dark inner lining, a denser fitted tongue, crossed laces seated at paired eyelets, bow loops and free ends. The upper and sole profiles use smooth longitudinal interpolation; rounded sole edges surround a broad flat underside. Native close-ups exposed tongue intersections, displaced lace endpoints and an uneven upper/sole join. Those findings led to denser tongue faces, matching endpoint projections and a deeper upper overlap inside the extended sole.",
  "remaining": "The full realism goal remains active. The next major character work is shoulder/armhole construction and jacket drape, followed by hand tendon/nail detail, convincing eye tissue, skin response and expression. Review the complete figure against the original concept before proceeding to architectural/retail variety and planting realism. This checkpoint is an editable offline model, not an animation rig, gameplay cloth implementation or runtime update."
